___NOTES___

Pinlyx Live Chat tag, version 1.

Loads https://api.pinlyx.com/js/widget.js?id=<widget id>, the same loader Pinlyx gives you as a script snippet. The loader then fetches the widget core and its settings from api.pinlyx.com.
Optional: https://api.pinlyx.com/js/cs.js?id=<site id> for Pinlyx Live Visitors analytics. The site ID is different from the widget ID.
Permissions: inject_script is limited to https://api.pinlyx.com/js/*. The logging permission is limited to debug mode.
